<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Laporan | Admin Tracer Study</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap"
        rel="stylesheet" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/admin/dashboard.css" />
    <style>
        .laporan-flex-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 24px;
            margin-top: 24px;
        }

        .laporan-card-custom {
            background: #fff;
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 32px 24px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            text-align: center;
            box-shadow: var(--shadow);
            transition: all var(--transition);
        }

        .laporan-card-custom:hover {
            transform: translateY(-4px);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
        }

        .laporan-icon-circle {
            width: 56px;
            height: 56px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .laporan-icon-circle.green {
            background: #e8f4ec;
            color: #2d6a4f;
        }

        .laporan-icon-circle.teal {
            background: #e0f2fe;
            color: #0369a1;
        }

        .laporan-icon-circle.blue {
            background: #f0fdf4;
            color: #15803d;
        }

        .laporan-icon-circle svg {
            width: 24px;
            height: 24px;
            fill: currentColor;
        }

        .laporan-card-custom h4 {
            font-size: 15px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #064E3B;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .laporan-card-custom p {
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #555;
            line-height: 1.5;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
            flex: 1;
        }

        .laporan-btns-row {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 12px;
            width: 100%;
        }

        .btn-laporan-outline {
            padding: 10px;
            border: 1.5px solid var(--border);
            background: #fff;
            color: #555;
            font-weight: 600;
            border-radius: 8px;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-size: 13px;
            text-decoration: none;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 6px;
            transition: all var(--transition);
        }

        .btn-laporan-outline:hover {
            background: #f5f5f5;
        }

        .btn-laporan-solid {
            padding: 10px;
            border: none;
            background: #064E3B;
            color: #fff;
            font-weight: 600;
            border-radius: 8px;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-size: 13px;
            text-decoration: none;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 6px;
            transition: all var(--transition);
        }

        .btn-laporan-solid:hover {
            background: #053d2f;
        }

        .btn-laporan-outline svg,
        .btn-laporan-solid svg {
            width: 15px;
            height: 15px;
            fill: currentColor;
        }

        /* Topbar search & actions */
        .topbar-search-wrap {
            position: relative;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            max-width: 320px;
            width: 100%;
        }

        .topbar-search-wrap svg {
            position: absolute;
            left: 12px;
            width: 16px;
            height: 16px;
            fill: #aaa;
        }

        .topbar-search-wrap input {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 8px 12px 8px 36px;
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 12px;
            outline: none;
            background: #f3f4f6;
            transition: all var(--transition);
        }

        .topbar-search-wrap input:focus {
            background: #fff;
            border-color: #2d6a4f;
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(45, 106, 79, 0.1);
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <%- include('_sidebar', { active: 'laporan' }) %>

        <main class="main-content">
            <!-- Topbar matching mockup -->
            <%- include('_topbar', { title: 'Laporan' , showSearch: true, searchAction: '/admin/laporan' ,
                searchPlaceholder: 'Cari laporan...' }) %>

                <div class="page-content" style="background:#fcfcf7; min-height: calc(100vh - 60px); padding: 24px;">
                    <!-- Card header matching mockup -->
                    <div class="form-container-box"
                        style="padding: 24px; margin-bottom: 20px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;">
                        <div>
                            <h2 style="font-size: 16px; font-weight: 800; color: #064E3B;">Laporan</h2>
                            <p style="font-size: 12px; color: #555; margin-top: 4px;">Pusat unduhan data dan
                                rekapitulasi sistem untuk monitoring alumni.</p>
                        </div>
                        <button onclick="location.reload()" class="btn-laporan-solid"
                            style="background:#064E3B; padding: 10px 20px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;">
                            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" style="width:14px;height:14px;">
                                <path
                                    d="M19 8l-4 4h3c0 3.31-2.69 6-6 6-1.01 0-1.97-.25-2.8-.7l-1.46 1.46C8.97 19.54 10.43 20 12 20c4.42 0 8-3.58 8-8h3l-4-4zM6 12c0-3.31 2.69-6 6-6 1.01 0 1.97.25 2.8.7l1.46-1.46C15.03 4.46 13.57 4 12 4c-4.42 0-8 3.58-8 8H1l4 4 4-4H6z" />
                            </svg>
                            Perbarui Data
                        </button>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Grid row of reports -->
                    <div class="laporan-flex-grid">
                        <!-- Card 1: Tracer Study -->
                        <div class="laporan-card-custom">
                            <div class="laporan-icon-circle green">
                                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                                    <path
                                        d="M19 3H5c-1.1 0-2 .9-2 2v14c0 1.1.9 2 2 2h14c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V5c0-1.1-.9-2-2-2zM9 17H7v-7h2v7zm4 0h-2V7h2v10zm4 0h-2v-4h2v4z" />
                                </svg>
                            </div>
                            <h4>Laporan Hasil Tracer Study</h4>
                            <p>Data komprehensif hasil pelacakan alumni yang mencakup analisis tingkat respons, sebaran
                                pekerjaan, dan evaluasi kurikulum berdasarkan masukan lulusan.</p>
                            <div class="laporan-btns-row">
                                <a href="/admin/laporan/preview" class="btn-laporan-outline">
                                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                                        <path
                                            d="M14 2H6c-1.1 0-1.99.9-1.99 2L4 20c0 1.1.89 2 1.99 2H18c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V8l-6-6zm2 16H8v-2h8v2zm0-4H8v-2h8v2zm-3-5V3.5L18.5 9H13z" />
                                    </svg>
                                    PDF
                                </a>
                                <a href="/admin/laporan/export/tracer" class="btn-laporan-solid">
                                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                                        <path
                                            d="M19.35 10.04C18.67 6.59 15.64 4 12 4 9.11 4 6.6 5.64 5.35 8.04 2.34 8.36 0 10.91 0 14c0 3.31 2.69 6 6 6h13c2.76 0 5-2.24 5-5 0-2.64-2.05-4.78-4.65-4.96zM17 13l-5 5-5-5h3V9h4v4h3z" />
                                    </svg>
                                    Excel
                                </a>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Card 2: Konseling Karir -->
                        <div class="laporan-card-custom">
                            <div class="laporan-icon-circle teal">
                                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                                    <path
                                        d="M11.99 2C6.47 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.47 10 9.99 10C17.52 22 22 17.52 22 12S17.52 2 11.99 2zM12 20c-4.42 0-8-3.58-8-8s3.58-8 8-8 8 3.58 8 8-3.58 8-8 8zm.5-13H11v6l5.25 3.15.75-1.23-4.5-2.67V7z" />
                                </svg>
                            </div>
                            <h4>Laporan Konseling Karir</h4>
                            <p>Rekapitulasi sesi konseling karir, penilaian performa konselor, serta tingkat partisipasi
                                alumni dalam program bimbingan persiapan kerja.</p>
                            <div class="laporan-btns-row">
                                <a href="/admin/laporan/preview?type=konseling" class="btn-laporan-outline">
                                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                                        <path
                                            d="M14 2H6c-1.1 0-1.99.9-1.99 2L4 20c0 1.1.89 2 1.99 2H18c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V8l-6-6zm2 16H8v-2h8v2zm0-4H8v-2h8v2zm-3-5V3.5L18.5 9H13z" />
                                    </svg>
                                    PDF
                                </a>
                                <a href="/admin/laporan/export/konseling" class="btn-laporan-solid">
                                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                                        <path
                                            d="M19.35 10.04C18.67 6.59 15.64 4 12 4 9.11 4 6.6 5.64 5.35 8.04 2.34 8.36 0 10.91 0 14c0 3.31 2.69 6 6 6h13c2.76 0 5-2.24 5-5 0-2.64-2.05-4.78-4.65-4.96zM17 13l-5 5-5-5h3V9h4v4h3z" />
                                    </svg>
                                    Excel
                                </a>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Card 3: Akses Lowongan -->
                        <div class="laporan-card-custom">
                            <div class="laporan-icon-circle blue">
                                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                                    <path d="M2.01 21L23 12 2.01 3 2 10l15 2-15 2z" />
                                </svg>
                            </div>
                            <h4>Laporan Akses Lowongan Kerja</h4>
                            <p>Metrik penggunaan bursa kerja internal, jumlah akses tombol "Lamar Sekarang" oleh alumni,
                                dan data pengisian form akses lowongan.</p>
                            <div class="laporan-btns-row">
                                <a href="/admin/laporan/preview?type=lowongan" class="btn-laporan-outline">
                                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                                        <path
                                            d="M14 2H6c-1.1 0-1.99.9-1.99 2L4 20c0 1.1.89 2 1.99 2H18c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V8l-6-6zm2 16H8v-2h8v2zm0-4H8v-2h8v2zm-3-5V3.5L18.5 9H13z" />
                                    </svg>
                                    PDF
                                </a>
                                <a href="/admin/laporan/export/lowongan" class="btn-laporan-solid">
                                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                                        <path
                                            d="M19.35 10.04C18.67 6.59 15.64 4 12 4 9.11 4 6.6 5.64 5.35 8.04 2.34 8.36 0 10.91 0 14c0 3.31 2.69 6 6 6h13c2.76 0 5-2.24 5-5 0-2.64-2.05-4.78-4.65-4.96zM17 13l-5 5-5-5h3V9h4v4h3z" />
                                    </svg>
                                    Excel
                                </a>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Footer -->
                    <div
                        style="text-align:center; border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0; padding-top:16px; font-size:11px; color:#777; margin-top:40px;">
                        &copy; 2026 Information Systems Fakultas Teknik Hamzanwadi University. All Rights Reserved.
                    </div>
                </div>
        </main>

        <script>
            function toggleSidebar() {
                document.getElementById('sidebar').classList.toggle('open');
            }
        </script>
</body>

</html>